[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7081.83, "timestamp": "01:58:01", "text": "[音乐]飙升得厉害，然后我就想，“啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7085.03, "timestamp": "01:58:05", "text": "这很糟糕。”   “"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7091.35, "timestamp": "01:58:11", "text": "直播的时候根本没法好好看东西。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7103.189, "timestamp": "01:58:23", "text": "我现在很迷茫，不知道该怎么办，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7108.229, "timestamp": "01:58:28", "text": "而且我现在的直播时间也得好好安排一下，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7111.43, "timestamp": "01:58:31", "text": "比如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7114.39, "timestamp": "01:58:34", "text": "我只能在晚上直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7117.27, "timestamp": "01:58:37", "text": "嗯，那到底"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7120.79, "timestamp": "01:58:40", "text": "什么时候直播呢？我还得早睡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7123.43, "timestamp": "01:58:43", "text": "。所以，我在考虑是不是要恢复到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7127.43, "timestamp": "01:58:47", "text": "以前的直播时间。嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7131.669, "timestamp": "01:58:51", "text": "就是日本时间下午6点或者5点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7134.07, "timestamp": "01:58:54", "text": "那是印度标准时间。那大概是"}]